From 3ce4f535f18da21137da212bd2f798f4769b11d3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 21:01:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] NOOVERLAP-C (web): Observer, Start Condition and Smart
 Diagnostic overlaps removed

EastSun 20260930: overlapping controls are not allowed.
- Data.Observer.html: two stray ">" characters in the markup were drawn
  at the top-left of every sheet; labDeviceName hidden (golden: fully
  under the alClient pgcObserv); the Record panels sized to the sheet
  (golden cuts them at its runtime width 1000, cObserver.cpp:364);
  btnTimeData off lstTimeData; the SG_JamCount buttons inside Panel2.
- Data.StartCondition.html: pnlKitNo1..3 anchored like alBottom;
  labContactCountAlarm 18px so it stops before its edit box.
- Data.SmartDiagnostic.html: the button-style tab row is hidden as golden
  hides it under the title panel (SmartDiagnostic.cpp:282-283; the speed
  buttons switch pages); caption panels centre their text; sgCylinder
  fits the sheet and scrolls sideways.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
